und\" />\n00134|         ) : (\n00135|           <ChevronDown className=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground\" />\n00136|         )}\n00137|       </button>\n00138| \n00139|       {isExpanded && (\n00140|         <div className=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-card border space-y-4\">\n00141|           <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n00142|             <SettingSlider\n00143|               label=\"Target Timeline Size\"\n00144|               value={settings.targetTimelineSize}\n00145|               min={5}\n00146|               max={15}\n00147|               step={1}\n00148|               onChange={(value) => handleSettingChange(\"targetTimelineSize\", value)}\n00149|               unit=\"cards\"\n00150|             />\n00151| \n00152|             <SettingSlider\n00153|               label=\"Starting Coins\"\n00154|               value={settings.startingCoins}\n00155|               min={1}\n00156|               max={10}\n00157|               step={1}\n00158|               onChange={(value) => handleSettingChange(\"startingCoins\", value)}\n00159|               unit=\"coins\"\n00160|             />\n00161| \n00162|             <SettingSlider\n00163|               label=\"Turn Duration\"\n00164|               value={settings.turnSeconds}\n00165|               min={15}\n00166|               max={120}\n00167|               step={5}\n00168|               onChange={(value) => handleSettingChange(\"turnSeconds\", value)}\n00169|               unit=\"seconds\"\n00170|             />\n00171| \n00172|             <SettingSlider\n00173|               label=\"Betting Window\"\n00174|               value={settings.bettingWindowSeconds}\n00175|               min={5}\n00176|               max={60}\n00177|               step={5}\n00178|               onChange={(value) => handleSettingChange(\"bettingWindowSeconds\", value)}\n00179|               unit=\"seconds\"\n00180|             />\n00181| \n00182|             <div className=\"sm:col-span-2\">\n00183|               <SettingRange\n00